WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Expanded EPP beads enter the feed system.

00:02.000 --> 00:07.000
Air carries the beads into the mould cavity.

00:07.000 --> 00:11.500
Steam bonds the beads into the component shape.

00:11.500 --> 00:15.500
The component cools with the mould closed.

00:15.500 --> 00:19.000
The mould opens to reveal the shaped foam part.

00:19.000 --> 00:24.000
The component is released onto a supported outfeed.
